    "Permanently deletes all scans, photos, routines, and badges from this device. This cannot be undone. Subscriptions can be restored via your Apple ID.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Löscht dauerhaft alle Scans, Fotos, Routinen und Abzeichen von diesem Gerät. Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden. Abos können über deine Apple-ID wiederhergestellt werden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permanently deletes all scans, photos, routines, and badges from this device. This cannot be undone. Subscriptions can be restored via your Apple ID."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elimina permanentemente todos los escaneos, fotos, rutinas e insignias de este dispositivo. No se puede deshacer. Las suscripciones se pueden restaurar con tu Apple ID."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supprime définitivement tous les scans, photos, routines et badges de cet appareil. Action irréversible. Les abonnements peuvent être restaurés via ton identifiant Apple."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elimina definitivamente tutte le scansioni, le foto, le routine e i badge da questo dispositivo. L'operazione è irreversibile. Gli abbonamenti si possono ripristinare con il tuo ID Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pore visibility is dragging the whole picture down, mostly through the T-zone.": {
